            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>By some accounts, pregnancy and delivery is the single most expensive group of diagnoses for employers providing insurance coverage. Contraception coverage is in the ACA and it's a good deal for insurers because contraception prevents unintended pregnancies. But complaints about limited options abound.</AbstractText>
